137
00:08:15,551 --> 00:08:17,491
Oh, I see, I see.

138
00:08:17,731 --> 00:08:21,571
Well, you can all come back to the Foxy Pirates now, so there's no need to cry.

139
00:08:24,751 --> 00:08:26,331
Come on, it's okay.

140
00:08:26,611 --> 00:08:29,691
Now that everyone's together again, it'll be just like old times.

141
00:08:30,011 --> 00:08:33,371
I hate to break it to you, Foxy, but I'm afraid that's not possible.

142
00:08:33,371 --> 00:08:36,051
Says who?

143
00:08:36,431 --> 00:08:38,331
Don't make me throw you off my ship!

144
00:08:38,711 --> 00:08:39,551
Your ship?

145
00:08:39,851 --> 00:08:42,851
This ship belongs to the Fang Frog Pirates now.

146
00:08:43,111 --> 00:08:46,171
In other words, these men are my underlings, not yours.

147
00:08:49,751 --> 00:08:50,231
Huh?

148
00:08:50,671 --> 00:08:51,571
Fang Frog?

149
00:08:52,051 --> 00:08:52,651
Who are they?

150
00:08:52,891 --> 00:08:57,931
Oh, they're those pirates we ran into who lost half of their crew to Foxy in a Davey Bat fight.

151
00:08:57,931 --> 00:09:01,111
But this time, Foxy's the one who lost all his stuff to them.

152
00:09:01,231 --> 00:09:03,411
Wow, that must suck for Splithead.

153
00:09:03,611 --> 00:09:07,271
That's what he gets for winning all of his crew members for some stupid game.

154
00:09:08,811 --> 00:09:11,131
I'll pass on the deal for farewell, thank you.

155
00:09:11,311 --> 00:09:12,151
Come on, let's go.

156
00:09:12,271 --> 00:09:13,071
We're done here.

157
00:09:13,351 --> 00:09:14,551
Not so fast.

158
00:09:14,551 --> 00:09:17,331
We still have some business to settle.

159
00:09:18,271 --> 00:09:22,991
You see, some of these new recruits of mine are still a bit too attached to their former boss.

160
