177
00:10:10,511 --> 00:10:11,491
He's on fire?

178
00:10:11,831 --> 00:10:13,011
That sounds dangerous.

179
00:10:13,671 --> 00:10:14,671
I'm not sure.

180
00:10:15,131 --> 00:10:17,311
Have a little more faith in your captain, Porcha.

181
00:10:17,531 --> 00:10:18,511
You should be happy.

182
00:10:19,231 --> 00:10:22,351
We'll have our old ship and our old crew back in no time.

183
00:10:24,771 --> 00:10:26,631
