222
00:12:46,031 --> 00:12:48,491
Just sit back and watch, Straw Hat.

223
00:12:48,491 --> 00:12:49,591
Yeah?

224
00:12:49,591 --> 00:12:51,031
I'll put my pride on the line

225
00:12:51,031 --> 00:12:53,731
