256
00:14:31,371 --> 00:14:36,111
Because as long as I'm here, I'll fight for them, with all the power I've got!

257
00:14:36,111 --> 00:14:36,571
Grr...

258
00:14:36,571 --> 00:14:37,711
Shut your-

259
00:14:37,711 --> 00:14:39,711
AHHHHH!

260
00:14:43,711 --> 00:14:45,711
BOOSTO!

261
00:14:46,711 --> 00:14:51,711
Hey! Split Head! Hang in there, it's not over yet!

262
